VALUES (468, 'tt0102494', NULL, 'My Own Private Idaho', 'My Own Private Idaho', 'movie', 1991, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9TF90Pb5yg2MNb2UztzyXktMm4.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/stSaFz5CtMXwIj3r4MDjqxqWRot.jpg', 'Mike Waters is a hustler afflicted with narcolepsy. Scott Favor is the rebellious son of a mayor. Together, the two travel from Portland, Oregon to Idaho and finally to the coast of Italy in a quest to find Mike''s estranged mother. Along the way they turn tricks for money and drugs, eventually attracting the attention of a wealthy benefactor and sexual deviant.', NULL, NULL, 3.3561, 7.038, 0, 3.9795428571428566e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-07 15:15:25')
