VALUES (10096, 'tt0337563', NULL, '13 Going on 30', '13 Going on 30', 'movie', 2004, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNZdSIfhSCMtRILDNyhLn8UKeSG.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ld7UTOGzZSxIMbuYsb6eQ6QdN4h.jpg', 'After total humiliation at her thirteenth birthday party, Jenna Rink wants to just hide until she''s thirty. Thanks to some magic wishing dust, Jenna''s prayer has been answered. With a knockout body, a fabulous wardrobe, an athlete boyfriend, a dream job, and superstar friends, this can''t be a better life. But soon Jenna realizes that adult life isn’t as easy as she hoped for.', NULL, NULL, 6.2188, 6.777, 0, 3.24286206896551689e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-07 15:15:25')
