VALUES (15035, 'tt0085542', NULL, 'Fire and Ice', 'Fire and Ice', 'movie', 1983, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmuw7qp5ldc0hOYx8HykhzAi8gH.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4yFQG3MSIAriY02pMg0BpgZjUA5.jpg', 'The villainous Nekron and his mother, Queen Juliana, plot against the human race from their frigid fortress. Creating mass destruction with huge glaciers, mother and son incur the wrath of Larn, a warrior whose entire village was destroyed by ice. When Nekron''s underlings kidnap the beautiful Princess Teegra, Larn sets out to rescue her, assisted by the fierce and enigmatic Darkwolf.', NULL, NULL, 3.5387, 6.686, 0, 23.4975, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-07 15:15:25')
