VALUES (206277, 'tt2636806', NULL, 'Shirley: Visions of Reality', 'Shirley: Visions of Reality', 'movie', 2013, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6DFANKi9cCgMCMQdDEBF6c8NGA.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tKTtKZlIlZpmUH6Lg9Vw8VPWr6v.jpg', 'A series of snapshots from the life of a fictional actress named Shirley serves to weave together thirteen paintings by Edward Hopper (e.g. "Office at Night", "Western Motel", "Usherette", "A Woman in the Sun") into a fascinating synthesis of painting and film, personal and political history. Each station in Shirley’s professional and private life from the 1930s to 1960s is precisely dated: It is always August 28/29 of the year in question, as the locations vary from Paris to New York to Cape Cod.', NULL, NULL, 0.8516, 6.1, 0, 3.01, '2026-08-04 03:20:13', '2026-11-07 15:15:25')
